      {
        "type": "obj",
        "bbox": [0, 0, 333, 333],
        "desc": "Wide establishing shot; a woman in lace lingerie reclines gracefully on a velvet chaise, soft morning light streaming through sheer curtains, evoking intimacy and luxury."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "bbox": [333, 0, 667, 333],
        "desc": "Full-body three-quarter pose of the model standing by a vintage mirror, her back arched subtly, showcasing the lace bodysuit and her silhouette."
